### CREO ALBARAN DE MATERIAL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "material",
  "description": "Entrega de materiales de obra",
  "workDate": "2026-04-13",
  "material": "Cemento",
  "quantity": 25,
  "unit": "sacos"
}
### CREO ALBARÁN DE HORAS
POST http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "hours",
  "description": "Jornada de trabajo en obra",
  "workDate": "2026-04-13",
  "hours": 8,
  "workers": [
    {
      "name": "Juan",
      "hours": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "Pedro",
      "hours": 4
    }
  ]
}
### LISTAR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### FILTRAR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote?page=1&limit=5&format=hours&signed=false&sort=-workDate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### FILTRO POR PROYECTO
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote?project={{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### FILTRO POR CLIENTE
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote?client={{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### FILTRO POR FECHA
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### OBTENER UNO
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### BORRAR
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### FIRMAR ALBARÁN
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="signature"; filename="firma.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./firma.png
--WebAppBoundary--
### DESCARGAR PDF
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote/pdf/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### INTENTAR BORRAR FIRMADO --> DEBE FALLAR
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}